      "short": "Bars centred at $1,2,3,4,5$ have heights $4,2,7,0,6$. Keep the zero-height interval at $4$. The completed histogram and polygon are shown.",
      "worked": "Draw unit-width bars with boundaries $0.5,1.5,2.5,3.5,4.5,5.5$ and heights $4,2,7,0,6$. Keep the interval from $3.5$ to $4.5$ at zero height. Join $(1,4),(2,2),(3,7),(4,0),(5,6)$, extending to $(0,0)$ and $(6,0)$.",
